Package: bande-nvram
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: read and write NVRAM variables on Apple Silicon Macs
 Reads and writes the Apple NVRAM partition on the SPI flash through the
 MTD device.

Package: bande-bless
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: select the boot volume on Apple Silicon Macs
 Selects the active boot partition, stored in the Apple NVRAM partition
 on the SPI flash.
